{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:8639c6c7d3738711","name":"Sith Military Training","source":{"id":"source:reference-8639c6c7d3738711","title":"Sith Military Training","revision":19331,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:45:20Z","sha256":"555152f2ef18dd7a20e908ecf3d365489a12c7e42897d9f125ca85bda1aa4712","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19331","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Sith%20Military%20Training&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-8639c6c7d3738711","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are trained in Sith military fighting techniques, giving you an advantage in melee combat. This training is generally given to rank and file military members of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith_Empire","referenceId":"reference:303e4cc32aa1a8e1"}," regardless of their Force training.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," Once per encounter, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," when you reduce a target to 0 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," or deal damage that exceeds the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},", you can activate this feat to cause all enemies within 6 squares of that target to take a -2 penalty to all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defenses"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defenses","referenceId":"reference:0d85b79fde210d9c"}," until the end of your next turn. This is a Mind-Affecting effect.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
